      {
        "t": 8,
        "text": "And on his farm he had a dog, E-I-E-I-O!"
      },
      {
        "t": 12,
        "text": "With a woof-woof here, and a woof-woof there!"
      },
      {
        "t": 16,
        "text": "And on his farm he had a cat, E-I-E-I-O!"
      },
      {
        "t": 20,
        "text": "With a meow-meow here, and a meow-meow there!"
      },
      {
        "t": 24,
        "text": "A yellow duck, a happy cow, a little pink pig!"
      },
      {
        "t": 28,
        "text": "With a quack-quack, moo-moo, oink-oink there!"
      },
      {
        "t": 32,
        "text": "Old MacDonald had a farm, E-I-E-I-O!"
      }
    ]
